{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the chaos of <i>Orb Raid</i>, where every bullet, blade, and explosion shapes the battlefield! Arm yourself with a devastating arsenal: shred enemies with machine guns, outsmart foes with tactical shotguns, or rain destruction via missile launchers and grenades. Deploy landmines for deadly traps, summon AI Shooter Bots for backup, and fortify positions with barricades\u2014every move is a step toward domination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into frenetic Team Deathmatches, strategize in Search &amp; Destroy to plant or defuse C4, seize glory in Capture The Flag, or conquer vast zones in Large Conquest. Customize your mercenary with unique gear, skins, and weapon mods\u2014craft a killer identity that strikes fear into rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create custom matches to challenge friends, test new tactics, or unleash pure mayhem. Adapt, outgun, and rise as the ultimate Renegade.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2309510?t=1743707997","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2309510?t=1743707997","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309510/d737aed5010562b1ba5560739e55c202ca4a47d9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743707997","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309510/d737aed5010562b1ba5560739e55c202ca4a47d9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743707997","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":51},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the chaos of <i>Orb Raid</i>, where every bullet, blade, and explosion shapes the battlefield! Arm yourself with a devastating arsenal: shred enemies with machine guns, outsmart foes with tactical shotguns, or rain destruction via missile launchers and grenades. Deploy landmines for deadly traps, summon AI Shooter Bots for backup, and fortify positions with barricades\u2014every move is a step toward domination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into frenetic Team Deathmatches, strategize in Search &amp; Destroy to plant or defuse C4, seize glory in Capture The Flag, or conquer vast zones in Large Conquest. Customize your mercenary with unique gear, skins, and weapon mods\u2014craft a killer identity that strikes fear into rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create custom matches to challenge friends, test new tactics, or unleash pure mayhem. Adapt, outgun, and rise as the ultimate Renegade.</p>","developers":["Caio Silva"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309510/89c1277e2a908bfa81312b42bea090491962aae4/header.jpg?t=1743707997","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257099065,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099065/movie480.mp4?t=1743703473","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099065/movie_max.mp4?t=1743703473"},"name":"Orb Raid Refactored Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_